      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `a9e59c0b3ce96eafb9a3ee55d19234fcd6714946d55bd8d35cc79a4128f9422d--summary-tables-1---3a-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2017-18\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 16585f56227c13238b400e3c091b751b7598dda057c00a1cadc9434ff4045b18 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | be3a7123596c4d07b4be742e9ca2a1f53bb49a405983a446c472fbd9e23cb4a8 | missing |\n| \"Table 1a\" | fbf04f55d31c8c1f09090d11c3cb54d5e25bedb240183adade4bf4e3beb26255 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 489b1be6d8c81f15e33fde89a0b2c4af9121f0c6424b94d090e41fad6246abb8 | missing |\n| \"Table 2a\" | d7264f1356bbd632360f79600d770f70608bfe078459819ca37c1cfa53cda54c | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 8ae5e9278f185c11d1a064f46d068460542e399caf224aa1b9b60b0649e98684 | missing |\n| \"Table 3a\" | d4be21bb705b3bb759a8908764cb08c591d4ce5c310b6457f45cb67e607fcceb | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
